  "body": "Release 0.23.0. This PR has the release notes, the changelog rows, the gathered decisions and the version bump.\n\n## Start condition\n- Start of the cut: 2026-11-17 15:57 UTC.\n- Open `P1` issues at the start: none.\n- Open `P2` issues at the start: none.\n- Main at the start: `a8bb30f0c` (the merge of PR #2363).\n- From this moment to the tag, no other PR merges to `main`.\n\n## Contents\n- `RELEASE_NOTES.md`: a new 0.23.0 section. The first section is \"Breaking\": the project file format goes from version 62 to 67.\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: 88 rows for the behaviour PRs merged after v0.22.0.\n- `RECOMMENDED.md`: 97 decision files gathered by `cargo xtask decisions --version 0.23.0`.\n- The version bump to 0.23.0 by `cargo xtask release --version 0.23.0 --no-tag --skip-gate`.\n- No source file changes.\n\n## Gate\n- The release tier runs on the cut runner: `cut.yml`, `stage=gate`, on this branch.\n- The pixel-snapshot lanes are skipped at this cut, by the decision of the maintainer. No golden PNG changes.\n- The Windows arms of the per-OS pinned readings are not run again for this PR.\n\n## Known issues\nNo `P1` or `P2` issue was filed after the start. The open `P3` defects 2354, 2356, 2357, 2359 and 2362 are in the release notes.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
